      "clauseId": "UNO-HOUSE-PENALTY-002",
      "sourceSection": "Draw chain and challenge (lines 729–731)",
      "sourceText": "Only the first +4 played from ordinary state is challengeable; a second +4 or a +4 used on a +2 chain permanently closes challenge for that chain.",
